OL,3,AKhan convicted for not taxing car he
OL,4,Adenies owning
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of London Sir Sadiq Khan has been
OL,7,Fconvicted and fined in a fast-track
OL,8,Fcourt system after being accused of not
OL,9,Ftaxing a 24-year-old Nissan Micra.
OL,11,FThe Labour politician, 55, was found
OL,12,Fguilty by a magistrate last month of
OL,13,Fkeeping an unlicensed vehicle, in a
OL,14,Fcriminal prosecution brought by the
OL,15,FDVLA.
OL,17,FCourt documents show that DVLA letters
OL,18,Faddressed to the mayor about the unpaid
OL,19,Ftax bill were sent to Gordon Ramsay's
OL,20,Feast London restaurant, instead of the
OL,21,Fnearby Transport for London (TfL)
OL,22,Foffices.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
